	"data": "VRIDE\n\nVR Interactive Development Environment in Unity. Most complete in-VR code environment found.\nRepo: <https://github.com/Vito217/VRIDE>\nLicense: MIT\nStars: 55, 450 commits\nStatus: Downloadable releases (v0.32.3), early WIP but functional\n\nWhat It Provides\nInteractable widgets: text editor, system browser, inspector, debugger\n3D visualization of code objects\nSave/resume environment state\nCollaborative programming (multi-user)\nPharo and Python support\nConnects to desktop streamer app\nBuilt…",
